{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/0586b7fc75d85e8bd565a919cd73a51a.avif?t=1755872198\" width=1600 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/3c67a72883c51afc47ded169c8fb5026.avif?t=1755872198\" width=1600 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/1e22ce1dd74b405ff20bc6a9ad32856f.poster.avif?t=1755872198\" width=854 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/1e22ce1dd74b405ff20bc6a9ad32856f.webm?t=1755872198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/1e22ce1dd74b405ff20bc6a9ad32856f.mp4?t=1755872198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magical gusli to damage the endless hordes of enemies. Use abilities and increase Sadko's power with temporary upgrades and stat boosts. Then you will be able to defeat all bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/2faa588c06f317d9d34442c02c5c6544.avif?t=1755872198\" width=1600 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/97b5cdd21db9191105134a6089af3579.avif?t=1755872198\" width=1600 height=567 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face enemies from four unique locations steeped in the color of the legends of all Slavic peoples. Moroki and Strygi will await you along the way, and you will come face to face with Baba Yaga. And who knows what other enemies lurk in these lands...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/1b7d5a6689d5e0231d1b2ffb97b59d82.avif?t=1755872198\" width=1600 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/2ed75d9591cd5ef9d5925cd9e06d0f52.avif?t=1755872198\" width=1600 height=339 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies won't wait for you to get stronger \u2014 use your abilities to the max: get new skills and meta-progress points to become permanently stronger, and destroy enemies to increase your stats or get temporary boosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/9f55f3ab807f8928f27f6357c7dbcb0b.avif?t=1755872198\" width=1600 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/50d6b0ceb01dbf4a0f5dd43b6eb18984.poster.avif?t=1755872198\" width=854 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/50d6b0ceb01dbf4a0f5dd43b6eb18984.webm?t=1755872198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413440/extras/50d6b0ceb01dbf4a0f5dd43b6eb18984.mp4?t=1755872198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main task will be to build a monument that will free Beloozero from evil forever. To do this, take all the materials you can find, 